      "protocol": "rc5",
      "address": "16",
      "codeset": "rc5-16",
      "needsDirectEmitter": true,
      "oneWay": true,
      "note": "Philips RC-5, device group 16 as a preamplifier. Group 16 is a device class rather than this product — Nagra's HD PREAMP answers it as well, so one frame reaches both and each unit needs its own emitter rather than a shared blaster."
    }
